enerated images were saved after epoch 400.\n","\n","## Performance Metrics and Results\n","### Tabular Data Dementia Prediction\n","| Feature Selection Method   | Augmentation | Accuracy | Loss    |\n","| :------------------------- | :----------- | :------- | :------ |\n","| RandomForest Feature Imp.  | SMOTE        | 0.908    | 0.200   |\n","| Correlation Analysis       | SMOTE        | 0.877    | 0.251   |\n","| RFE                        | SMOTE        | 0.905    | 0.210   |\n","| PCA                        | SMOTE        | 0.841    | 0.337   |\n","| **RFE + TabGAN Augmentation** | SMOTE + GAN  | **0.982**| **0.043** |\n","\n","### Image Data Dementia Prediction\n","| Model                  | Dataset Type       | Accuracy | Loss    |\n","| :--------------------- | :----------------- | :------- | :------ |\n","| SimpleCNN              | Original (sampled) | 1.00     | 0.001   |\n","| **SimpleCNN**          | **DCGAN Augmented**| **0.56** | **0.684** |\n","\n","**Note on Image Model Accuracy:** The 100% accuracy on the original image dataset suggests significant overfitting, likely due to the small dataset size relative to model complexity and number of epochs. The subsequent drop to 56% accuracy when including DCGAN-generated images indicates that the synthetic images, as currently generated, do not effectively improve model generalization.\n","\n","## How to Run/Reproduce\n","1.  **Clone the repository** (if hosted on GitHub) or download the notebook.\n","2.  **Prepare Data:**\n","    *   Place `dataset.csv` in the same directory as the notebook or adjust the path in the code.\n","    *   Ensure your Google Drive is mounted and the MRI image dataset (`Dementia_data` folder containing 'Non Demented' and 'Moderate Dementia' subfolders) is accessible at `/content/drive/MyDrive/Dementia_data`.\n","3.  **Install Dependencies:** All necessary libraries are standard in Google Colab (Pandas, Numpy, Scikit-learn, TensorFlow, PyTorch, Matplotlib, Seaborn, imblearn, PIL). 